### BitriPay Gateway API quick reference (VS Code REST Client format) — generated from GET /api/v1/openapi.json, do not edit by hand
### Merchant keys: sk_live_/sk_test_ secret keys, rk_ restricted keys with scopes, pk_ publishable keys. Every money-moving POST takes an Idempotency-Key.
@api = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@key = sk_test_paste-your-key-here

### ---------------- Payment intents ----------------
### Create a payment intent (returns checkout_url, qr_payload and client_secret) (scope: payment_intents:write)
POST {{api}}/payment_intents
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_minor": 0,
  "currency": "",
  "rails": [],
  "capture_method": "",
  "payment_method_policy": "",
  "reference": "",
  "description": "",
  "purpose_code": "",
  "expires_in_minutes": 0,
  "metadata": {},
  "customer_msisdn": "",
  "customer_country": "",
  "success_url": "",
  "cancel_url": "",
  "qr": false,
  "splits": []
}

### List payment intents (scope: payment_intents:read)
GET {{api}}/payment_intents?status=&limit=
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Retrieve a payment intent (scope: payment_intents:read)
GET {{api}}/payment_intents/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Every state change and attempt of an intent (scope: payment_intents:read)
GET {{api}}/payment_intents/{{id}}/timeline
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Cancel an intent that has not been captured (scope: payment_intents:write)
POST {{api}}/payment_intents/{{id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Payment methods available to the payer for this intent (scope: payment_intents:read)
GET {{api}}/payment_intents/{{id}}/methods
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Split payouts made from a captured intent (scope: payment_intents:read)
GET {{api}}/payment_intents/{{id}}/splits
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### ---------------- Refunds ----------------
### Amount still refundable on an intent (scope: refunds:read)
GET {{api}}/payment_intents/{{id}}/refundable
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Refund a captured intent (atomic reservation; wallet or processor) (scope: refunds:write)
POST {{api}}/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payment_intent": "",
  "amount_minor": 0,
  "reason": ""
}

### List refunds (scope: refunds:read)
GET {{api}}/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Retrieve a refund (scope: refunds:read)
GET {{api}}/refunds/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### ---------------- Checkout ----------------
### Create a hosted checkout session with line items (scope: checkout_sessions:write)
POST {{api}}/checkout_sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### List checkout sessions (scope: payment_intents:read)
GET {{api}}/checkout_sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Retrieve a checkout session (scope: payment_intents:read)
