### Create a single-use or reusable payment link (scope: payment_links:write)
POST {{api}}/payment_links
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### List payment links (scope: payment_links:write)
