Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Deactivate a link (scope: payment_links:write)
POST {{api}}/payment_links/{{id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ---------------- QR ----------------
### Create a static BitriQR (EMVCo + signed extension) (scope: qr_codes:write)
POST {{api}}/qr_codes
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### List QR codes (scope: qr_codes:read)
GET {{api}}/qr_codes
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Scan analytics (scope: qr_codes:read)
GET {{api}}/qr_codes/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Revoke a code (lost, stolen, tampered, replaced, retired) (scope: qr_codes:write)
POST {{api}}/qr_codes/{{id}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Resolve any scanned payload (public; trust from the key registry)
POST {{api}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Public signing-key registry (ed25519, ETag cached)
GET {{api}}/keys
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Create a merchant location (scope: qr_codes:write)
POST {{api}}/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Add a terminal to a location (scope: qr_codes:write)
POST {{api}}/locations/{{id}}/terminals
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ---------------- Verifications (KODA) ----------------
### Scan-to-Verify: did a payment reach me? (reference, or MSISDN + amount) (scope: verifications:write)
POST {{api}}/verifications
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Free quota and price (scope: verifications:write)
GET {{api}}/verifications/quota
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### ---------------- Wallets ----------------
### Wallet balances with the available amount after holds (scope: wallets:read)
GET {{api}}/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### ---------------- Transfers ----------------
### Quote a transfer with the full fee and FX disclosure, plus rails ranked by the smart router (scope: transfers:write)
POST {{api}}/transfers/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_minor": 0,
  "currency": "",
  "target_currency": "",
  "destination": {},
  "source_method": "",
  "policy": ""
}

### Send from the wallet to another BitriPay account (scope: transfers:write)
POST {{api}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "",
  "amount_minor": 0,
  "currency": "",
  "note": ""
}

### Retrieve a transfer (scope: transfers:read)
GET {{api}}/transfers/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### ---------------- Cross-border routes ----------------
### Quote any → any: fund from the wallet or any card / bank / mobile money, deliver to a wallet, QR, bank account, mobile money number or agent anywhere, in the currency the recipient will receive; rate, margin and every fee disclosed (scope: routes:read)
POST {{api}}/routes/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_minor": 0,
  "currency": "",
  "target_currency": "",
  "source": {},
  "destination": {}
}

### Which currencies the recipient can receive for a destination right now (corridor rules, licence, liquidity) (scope: routes:read)
POST {{api}}/routes/payout-currencies
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_minor": 0,
  "currency": "",
  "destination": {},
  "requested": ""
}

### Create a route: the funding leg runs through the processor (card / bank / mobile money) or the wallet, the payout leg follows automatically once funds are confirmed (scope: routes:write)
POST {{api}}/routes
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_minor": 0,
  "currency": "",
  "target_currency": "",
  "source": {},
  "destination": {},
  "note": "",
  "quote_id": "",
  "source_of_funds": ""
}

### List routes (scope: routes:read)
GET {{api}}/routes?limit=
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Retrieve a route with its stage, quote, funding payment and payout (scope: routes:read)
GET {{api}}/routes/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Receipt for a settled route (scope: routes:read)
GET {{api}}/routes/{{id}}/receipt
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Cancel before the payout is executed (funds return; card funding refunded where the processor allows) (scope: routes:write)
POST {{api}}/routes/{{id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": ""
}

### ---------------- Remittances ----------------
### Quote an international transfer (scope: remittances:read)
GET {{api}}/remittances/quote?amount_minor=&currency=&target_currency=
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Send an international transfer to a wallet, bank account, mobile money number or cash pickup in the recipient currency; add a `source` (any card, bank or mobile money) to fund it through a processor instead of the wallet (scope: remittances:write)
POST {{api}}/remittances
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_minor": 0,
  "currency": "",
  "target_currency": "",
  "payout_method": "",
  "recipient": {},
  "source": {},
  "note": ""
}

### List remittances (scope: remittances:read)
GET {{api}}/remittances
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### ---------------- Bulk payouts ----------------
### CSV columns accepted for a batch upload (scope: payouts:read)
GET {{api}}/payouts/batches/columns
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Upload a payout batch (rows or CSV); every row is validated and the totals are returned before approval (scope: payouts:write)
POST {{api}}/payouts/batches
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currency": "",
  "rows": [],
  "csv": "",
  "reference": "",
  "note": "",
  "skip_invalid": false
}

### List payout batches (scope: payouts:read)
GET {{api}}/payouts/batches?status=&limit=
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Retrieve a batch with its rows and readiness (funds, invalid rows, approval rule) (scope: payouts:read)
GET {{api}}/payouts/batches/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Approve and execute a batch: four-eyes by another account holder, or the creator under PIN / passkey step-up (scope: payouts:approve)
POST {{api}}/payouts/batches/{{id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pin": ""
}

### Cancel a batch awaiting approval (scope: payouts:write)
POST {{api}}/payouts/batches/{{id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ---------------- Agents ----------------
### Run an agent (canonical names such as RouteOptimiser, FraudScorer, SavingsAdvisor accepted); metered in ACU, provider and model never disclosed (scope: ai:run)
POST {{api}}/ai/{{agent}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "",
  "context": {},
  "depth": "",
  "wait": false
}

### Retrieve an agent run (scope: ai:run)
GET {{api}}/ai/runs/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### ---------------- Subscriptions ----------------
### List your subscription plans (scope: subscriptions:read)
GET {{api}}/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Create a plan (interval, trial, tax, metered usage) (scope: subscriptions:write)
POST {{api}}/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "currency": "",
  "amount_minor": 0,
  "interval": "",
  "interval_count": 0,
  "trial_days": 0,
  "tax_bps": 0,
  "tax_label": "",
  "usage_unit": "",
  "usage_price_minor": 0,
  "code": ""
}

### Retrieve a plan (scope: subscriptions:read)
GET {{api}}/plans/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Stop offering a plan (existing subscriptions continue) (scope: subscriptions:write)
POST {{api}}/plans/{{id}}/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### List subscriptions with a billing overview (recurring revenue, collections, dunning) (scope: subscriptions:read)
GET {{api}}/subscriptions?status=&limit=
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Retrieve a subscription with its invoices (scope: subscriptions:read)
GET {{api}}/subscriptions/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Record metered usage for the current period (scope: subscriptions:write)
POST {{api}}/subscriptions/{{id}}/usage
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 0,
  "note": ""
}

### Cancel at period end (or immediately) (scope: subscriptions:write)
POST {{api}}/subscriptions/{{id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "immediately": false
}

### List invoices (scope: subscriptions:read)
GET {{api}}/invoices?limit=
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### ---------------- Credit readiness ----------------
### Read a consented credit-readiness signal (score, band, factors); never the transactions, never a lending decision (scope: credit:read)
GET {{api}}/credit_readiness/{{code}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

