### Pay out to a bank account or mobile-money number (scope: payouts:write)
POST {{api}}/payouts
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### List payouts (scope: payouts:read)
GET {{api}}/payouts
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### ---------------- Balance ----------------
### Balance classes: available, pending, reserved, settlement_pending, held, disputed, frozen (scope: balance:read)
GET {{api}}/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### ---------------- Settlement ----------------
### Settlement profiles per rail and currency (scope: settlements:read)
GET {{api}}/settlement_profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Create or update a profile (T0/T1/T2/weekly/manual, cut-off, destination, minimum) (scope: settlements:write)
POST {{api}}/settlement_profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Upcoming cut-offs, obligations and recent cycles (scope: settlements:read)
GET {{api}}/settlement_calendar
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### List cycles (scope: settlements:read)
GET {{api}}/settlement_cycles
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Close the running period now (optionally pay) (scope: settlements:write)
POST {{api}}/settlement_cycles
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Numbered, hashed statement (format=json|csv|pdf) (scope: settlements:read)
GET {{api}}/settlement_cycles/{{id}}/statement?format=
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Pay a closed cycle to its destination (scope: settlements:write)
POST {{api}}/settlement_cycles/{{id}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

